WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.958 --> 00:00:32.416
In the previous verses, Lord Krishna
had explained

2
00:00:32.416 --> 00:00:34.208
that the worship of the devas

3
00:00:34.208 --> 00:00:36.958
is part of Vedic tradition, but

4
00:00:36.958 --> 00:00:40.000
from it only temporary fruits are gained.

5
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.333
Now in this verse too,

6
00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:43.083
He sheds direct light

7
00:00:43.083 --> 00:00:45.375
on the nature of worshipping the devas.

8
00:00:45.375 --> 00:00:46.791
He makes clear

9
00:00:46.791 --> 00:00:48.125
that although such worship

10
00:00:48.125 --> 00:00:50.333
ultimately reaches Him,

11
00:00:50.333 --> 00:00:53.291
it is done incorrectly,

12
00:00:53.291 --> 00:00:55.833
and does not show the path to liberation.

13
00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:02.875
Lord Krishna explains to us

14
00:01:02.875 --> 00:01:05.500
that even those who worship the devas

15
00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:07.708
are ultimately worshipping Him,

16
00:01:07.708 --> 00:01:08.875
because in the universe every

17
00:01:08.875 --> 00:01:10.541
power and every form

18
00:01:10.541 --> 00:01:13.041
is a manifestation of His energy.

19
00:01:13.041 --> 00:01:16.750
Yet their approach is done incorrectly.

20
00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:18.000
This means

21
00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:20.625
that such worshippers do not understand

22
00:01:20.625 --> 00:01:23.458
that the devas are not independent,
but Lord Krishna's

23
00:01:23.458 --> 00:01:26.875
empowered representatives, nothing more.

24
00:01:26.875 --> 00:01:29.333
When someone worships the devas,

25
00:01:29.333 --> 00:01:30.333
they are usually

26
00:01:30.333 --> 00:01:33.000
driven by specific desires.

27
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:37.166
The wish to gain wealth, success,
or momentary happiness –

28
00:01:37.166 --> 00:01:40.250
these desires become the basis of worship.

29
00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:42.708
The devas may fulfil these wishes,

30
00:01:42.708 --> 00:01:46.583
but these fruits are temporary and limited.

31
00:01:46.583 --> 00:01:49.041
On the other hand, devotion to Lord Krishna

32
00:01:49.041 --> 00:01:51.000
gives directly eternal joy

33
00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:54.375
and freedom from the cycle of birth and death.

34
00:01:54.375 --> 00:01:57.083
Lord Krishna compares these two paths

35
00:01:57.083 --> 00:01:59.208
to the nourishment of a tree.

36
00:01:59.208 --> 00:02:00.750
The worship of the devas is like

37
00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:03.458
watering the leaves and branches

38
00:02:03.458 --> 00:02:05.583
instead of the root of the tree.

39
00:02:05.583 --> 00:02:08.541
The tree may look green for some time,

40
00:02:08.541 --> 00:02:11.791
but without nourishment

41
00:02:11.791 --> 00:02:14.125
at the root, it cannot survive.

42
00:02:14.125 --> 00:02:16.208
In the same way, on the original source,

43
00:02:16.208 --> 00:02:18.541
Lord Krishna, when one focuses,

44
00:02:18.541 --> 00:02:21.958
every aspect of life, material and spiritual

45
00:02:21.958 --> 00:02:24.875
both, becomes nourished and complete.

46
00:02:24.875 --> 00:02:27.041
Lord Krishna does not criticise

47
00:02:27.041 --> 00:02:30.208
the worship of the devas,
but He certainly clarifies

48
00:02:30.208 --> 00:02:32.458
that this path in the direction of the full truth

49
00:02:32.458 --> 00:02:35.166
is an incomplete attempt only.

50
00:02:35.166 --> 00:02:38.750
It is a path that gives limited benefit

51
00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:41.458
and does not provide a lasting solution.

52
00:02:41.458 --> 00:02:43.375
This worship is based on understanding

53
00:02:43.375 --> 00:02:46.458
only a part of reality.

54
00:02:46.458 --> 00:02:49.375
It does not reflect the complete truth.

55
00:02:49.375 --> 00:02:50.625
When someone

56
00:02:50.625 --> 00:02:53.208
worships Lord Krishna directly,

57
00:02:53.208 --> 00:02:56.000
that seeker, instead of getting lost,

58
00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:57.625
connects with the very goal

59
00:02:57.625 --> 00:03:01.375
that is the final purpose of all worship.

60
00:03:01.375 --> 00:03:03.833
Connection with the Supreme – eternal

61
00:03:03.833 --> 00:03:08.375
joy and lasting peace.

62
00:03:08.375 --> 00:03:09.375
This verse

63
00:03:09.375 --> 00:03:11.291
signals to us

64
00:03:11.291 --> 00:03:14.333
not to limit our life's worship to fleeting gains,

65
00:03:14.333 --> 00:03:17.500
but to move beyond.

66
00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:19.375
Toward that deeper purpose

67
00:03:19.375 --> 00:03:20.250
where the soul

68
00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:21.541
can experience itself

69
00:03:21.541 --> 00:03:23.916
in its truest form connected

70
00:03:23.916 --> 00:03:27.541
to the Supreme – this is true yoga.

71
00:03:27.541 --> 00:03:30.250
This is true worship.

72
00:03:35.208 --> 00:03:38.541
Just as a seed, to sprout,

73
00:03:38.541 --> 00:03:41.208
needs the right soil, water,

74
00:03:41.208 --> 00:03:44.708
and sunlight,

75
00:03:44.708 --> 00:03:47.458
in exactly the same way, success

76
00:03:47.458 --> 00:03:51.625
flourishes only through the right means.

77
00:03:51.625 --> 00:03:53.500
In the choice of path itself

78
00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:56.916
lies the seed of success.

79
00:03:56.916 --> 00:03:58.041
In life,

80
00:03:58.041 --> 00:04:01.375
the goal we wish to attain –

81
00:04:01.375 --> 00:04:03.958
the path that takes us there

82
00:04:03.958 --> 00:04:09.083
is just as important as the goal itself.

83
00:04:09.083 --> 00:04:11.458
On the path of practice, if

84
00:04:11.458 --> 00:04:15.291
you choose incorrect or shortcut paths,

85
00:04:15.291 --> 00:04:16.583
it may be

86
00:04:16.583 --> 00:04:20.916
that you not only miss your goal, but

87
00:04:20.916 --> 00:04:23.250
find yourself in even more

88
00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:26.458
difficult circumstances than when you started.

89
00:04:26.458 --> 00:04:28.916
Consider –

90
00:04:28.916 --> 00:04:30.583
the student

91
00:04:30.583 --> 00:04:33.208
who, instead of gaining knowledge,

92
00:04:33.208 --> 00:04:34.416
sets the goal of

93
00:04:34.416 --> 00:04:37.708
only passing the exam,

94
00:04:37.708 --> 00:04:41.666
he may find temporary success, but

95
00:04:41.666 --> 00:04:44.291
in the real tests of life

96
00:04:44.291 --> 00:04:47.500
he will be found lacking.

97
00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:49.208
When I

98
00:04:49.208 --> 00:04:53.583
speak of acting 'incorrectly,'

99
00:04:53.583 --> 00:04:56.041
I mean placing the importance of

100
00:04:56.041 --> 00:05:01.583
process and path above all else.

101
00:05:01.583 --> 00:05:04.583
If you want to receive

102
00:05:04.583 --> 00:05:06.583
the fruit, then be patient.

103
00:05:06.583 --> 00:05:09.000
Work with integrity.

104
00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:11.916
Make hard work your companion,

105
00:05:11.916 --> 00:05:13.750
and let your efforts

106
00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:15.625
be guided by dharma.

107
00:05:15.625 --> 00:05:17.000
Then see –

108
00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:20.125
you will not only reach your goal,

109
00:05:20.125 --> 00:05:23.208
but grow in such a way

110
00:05:23.208 --> 00:05:25.583
that lasting contentment

111
00:05:25.583 --> 00:05:28.958
becomes a permanent part of your life.

112
00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:36.625
Have you ever thought that

113
00:05:36.625 --> 00:05:41.958
when we look at many things instead of one,

114
00:05:41.958 --> 00:05:45.750
how divided our vision becomes?

115
00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:48.750
When people worship different devas

116
00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:52.583
to fulfil different desires –

117
00:05:52.583 --> 00:05:53.750
some for wealth,

118
00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:57.416
some for health, some for success –

119
00:05:57.416 --> 00:05:59.333
they do not understand

120
00:05:59.333 --> 00:06:02.541
that all powers

121
00:06:02.541 --> 00:06:05.791
flow from a single source.

122
00:06:05.791 --> 00:06:10.791
Just as all rivers appear
separate from their origin,

123
00:06:10.791 --> 00:06:15.750
but ultimately merge only into the ocean,

124
00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:20.875
in the same way all devas
are simply My expressions.

125
00:06:20.875 --> 00:06:22.333
Notice this.

126
00:06:22.333 --> 00:06:26.291
When you worship other devas,

127
00:06:26.291 --> 00:06:30.416
your offering indirectly

128
00:06:30.416 --> 00:06:32.750
reaches Me alone.

129
00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:35.666
But it is like

130
00:06:35.666 --> 00:06:38.958
you are giving up the direct path

131
00:06:38.958 --> 00:06:43.166
and choosing a winding one instead.

132
00:06:43.166 --> 00:06:47.583
In society too, people chase quick fixes

133
00:06:47.583 --> 00:06:51.375
and momentary pleasures.

134
00:06:51.375 --> 00:06:54.416
Would it not be wiser

135
00:06:54.416 --> 00:06:57.208
to go deeper into life

136
00:06:57.208 --> 00:07:00.000
and recognise its essential truth?

137
00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:03.416
When you open the doors of your heart

138
00:07:03.416 --> 00:07:06.541
and come directly to Me,

139
00:07:06.541 --> 00:07:11.250
then all your efforts take deep root

140
00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:14.041
and yield more lasting fruit.

141
00:07:14.041 --> 00:07:15.416
Remember,

142
00:07:15.416 --> 00:07:16.666
if you

143
00:07:16.666 --> 00:07:20.458
want true fulfilment, whether

144
00:07:20.458 --> 00:07:24.291
it is material or spiritual,

145
00:07:24.291 --> 00:07:28.250
then choose your path in alignment
 with dharma

146
00:07:28.250 --> 00:07:32.541
and become a partaker of eternal joy.

147
00:07:37.583 --> 00:07:39.375
Have you ever

148
00:07:39.375 --> 00:07:42.750
seen a castle built on sand?

149
00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:45.958
How quickly it collapses.

150
00:07:45.958 --> 00:07:48.375
In exactly the same way,

151
00:07:48.375 --> 00:07:52.666
success whose foundation is not on solid ground,

152
00:07:52.666 --> 00:07:56.000
it never remains stable.

153
00:07:56.000 --> 00:08:00.625
If, instead of real quality work,

154
00:08:00.625 --> 00:08:03.041
in seeking the praise

155
00:08:03.041 --> 00:08:06.416
of your superiors you spend your energy,

156
00:08:06.416 --> 00:08:07.791
it may be

157
00:08:07.791 --> 00:08:11.666
that you gain temporary reward, but

158
00:08:11.666 --> 00:08:13.000
true standing

159
00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:15.750
you will not be able to build.

160
00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:18.291
Imagine that person

161
00:08:18.291 --> 00:08:21.416
who, instead of pursuing excellence,

162
00:08:21.416 --> 00:08:25.291
remains busy polishing his image.

163
00:08:25.291 --> 00:08:28.375
Just as a flower cut from a plant

164
00:08:28.375 --> 00:08:33.083
may for some time look beautiful,
but in a short while

165
00:08:33.083 --> 00:08:35.250
it begins to wither.

166
00:08:35.250 --> 00:08:38.333
The flower of effort-earned success too

167
00:08:38.333 --> 00:08:40.500
blooms only as long

168
00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:45.041
as it stays connected to the plant of hard work.

169
00:08:45.041 --> 00:08:50.125
Dedication, consistency, and hard work –

170
00:08:50.125 --> 00:08:52.833
these three are the pillars that build

171
00:08:52.833 --> 00:08:55.875
the structure of lasting success.

172
00:08:55.875 --> 00:08:57.500
Listen carefully –

173
00:08:57.500 --> 00:09:02.250
when you work with excellence,

174
00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:05.458
not only do your abilities grow,

175
00:09:05.458 --> 00:09:08.666
but in your professional environment

176
00:09:08.666 --> 00:09:12.833
you also earn respect and trust.

177
00:09:12.833 --> 00:09:14.458
With integrity

178
00:09:14.458 --> 00:09:16.791
fulfil your duty.

179
00:09:16.791 --> 00:09:19.083
Actions done with purity

180
00:09:19.083 --> 00:09:21.291
are not only fruitful,

181
00:09:21.291 --> 00:09:25.208
but they are also lasting.

182
00:09:25.208 --> 00:09:26.458
From righteous actions

183
00:09:26.458 --> 00:09:30.500
the success that comes brings into your life

184
00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:35.458
self-confidence and peace of mind.
